insert into public.lessons (id, kind, number, title, video_url, body, retired) values ('c248e5ad-7999-53c6-b159-78c964728ad8', 'smf', 6, 'Your PMA', null, 'Learn to adjust yourself to other peoples state of mind

Condition your mind at the beginning of each day

Adopt the habit of having a good-hearted laugh. This will change the chemistry of brain.

Start each day by expressing gratitude, for your successes and failures.

Focus on what you CAN do right now and take action on it

Take immediate action on all unpleasant circumstances in your life

Learn from every experience

Accept all criticism of yourself

Help someone who is worse off than you - for what you do upon others, you do upon yourself

Do not accept from life or anything else anything you do not desire

Always look at yourself first and what you could do better yourself

And of course, always remember that whatever your mind can believe and conceive, it can achieve.

Click here to check in for your 6th week:
{Training Magic Link training_slug=week-7-habits-and-homework}

