insert into public.lessons (id, kind, number, title, video_url, body, retired) values ('75351104-348b-5a6e-8de9-3c9d189cb3da', 'smf', 8, 'Enthusiasm', null, '"Knowledge is power" <--You might''ve heard this saying before

And you might''ve also heard that "Knowledge is only power if it is put into action"

But truth is that knowledge is only power if it is put into action WITH high energy and enthusiasm.

Enthusiasm is the often overlooked component that many don''t deem necessary

However...

Enthusiasm brings your thoughts on a higher vibration level.

And this causes them to be contagious and more well-received by others.

When you’re enthusiastic, you carry over your positive mental attitude towards others - which gives sound health to both parties involved.

Remember, only 2 things will ever give you a stomach ulcer:

1. Worry

2. Negative attitudes

Prevent ulcers (and other ailments) by practicing your positive mental attitude, every day.

Click here to check in for Week 8:
