insert into public.lessons (id, kind, number, title, video_url, body, retired) values ('e19894ec-2530-581c-a992-88f77899b359', 'smf', 9, 'Personal Initiative', null, '“There are 2 kinds of people who never amount to much; those who can not do as they are told, and those who can do nothing else”

That''s a deep quote

It means you need to listen to your coach

But also make your OWN judgements and do things on your own

Put short, if you want to lose weight, your success will rely 100% on your very own efforts and initiative.

Taking initiative not only inspires you to move - it influences you to carry through until you’re 100% finished.

(Because as you know - a winner never quits, and a quitter never wins)

Great success is always made up of little circumstances, each of which so small and insignificant that most people don’t even notice them.

Taking initiative is one of those ''little circumstances''.

People who take initiative:
1. Have a master purpose and work towards pursuing it.
2. Make decisions fast and deviate from them slow.
3. Accept full responsibility for everything that happens whether right or wrong.

Practice your personal initiative - it will put your progress in fast-forward.

Click here to check in for Week 9:
{Training Magic Link training_slug=week-10-habits-and-homework}

