insert into public.lessons (id, kind, number, title, video_url, body, retired) values ('34943b10-264b-5132-bd3c-dd8eff0970ae', 'smf', 22, 'How you see the world, versus how it is', null, 'We all have stories we tell ourselves

And it''s those stories that ''shape'' the world we live in

So in other words, we can create our own world by means of our own thoughts and assumptions

This is why, the life you see right now does not have to be the life of your future

Change your perception by realizing this:

> You see the world not as it is, but as you are <<

Not many people look beyond that

But when you find one, join that person.

Because those are the people that will make you believe in yourself

They''ll challenge you to leave your comfort zone

And they''ll change your thinking.

Remember, your thinking creates your life

And the quality of your life runs parallel to the quality of your thinking

