insert into public.lessons (id, kind, number, title, video_url, body, retired) values ('f15c3fe0-98cf-59fb-8155-cf8de3838f22', 'smf', 26, '6 positive emotions to occupy your mind with', null, 'Out of all the emotions you can feel, the 6 most positive ones are:

1. Desire
2. Faith
3. Love
4. Enthusiasm
5. Romance
6. Hope

On the flipside, the 6 most negative ones are:

1. Fear
2. Jealousy
3. Hatred
4. Revenge
5. Greed
6. Superstition

The reason I''m sending you this is because your brain can not contain both a positive and negative emotion at the same time.

In other words, you either think positive, or negative.

There is no in-between.

Any presence of a negative emotion will destroy your subconscious mind and what it can do for you.

Therefore you and you alone are 100% responsible that positive emotions occupy your mind at all times.

If you do, the negative emotions will simply not be able to enter your mind.

Others might think you''re ''too positive''

But the only time you rise is when you''re positive

It''s that simple.

Click here to check in for Week 26:
{Training Magic Link training_slug=week-27-habits-and-homework}

