insert into public.lessons (id, kind, number, title, video_url, body, retired) values ('ea01c2c2-b62c-57c9-9469-8c88917c1010', 'smf', 29, '3 best ways to say no to vampires', null, 'It is human nature to be:

- lazy

- indifferent

- and susceptible to all suggestions which harmonize with our weaknesses.

That''s why it''s so important to:

1... Ignore people who depress or discourage you

2... Clean out your prescription medicines you know you don''t need, throw away all supplements promising quick fixes, and stop falling for colds, aches, and imaginary illnesses

3... Deliberately seek the company of people who influence you to think and act for yourself.

Number 1 might cause some ''drama''

Number 2 is only becoming more and more prevalent

But number 3 is the hardest

The best way to accomplish number 3 is to pay money

Pay money to join a coaching program, hire a mentor, or gain ''access'' to those who have accomplished what you want and are willing to teach you.

Without doubt, the most common weakness of human beings is to leave your mind open to the negative influence of others.

Once you realize this...

... that the vampires are coming at you 24/7 (through your friends, family, but also the media).

Then use that knowledge to detect when it happens.

And follow the 3 tips above to minimize your exposure.

Click here to check in for Week 29:
{Training Magic Link training_slug=week-30-habits-and-homework}

